<section class="view show">
 <div class="rowBtns"><a class="btn" href="/tenant/mobile-money">Manual Mobile Money entry</a><span class="tag"><%= data.usage %> / <%= data.limit %> SMS this month</span></div>
 <section class="card" style="margin-top:14px"><div class="cardHead"><b>SMS inbox</b><span>100 items per page · retained for 30 days</span></div><div class="cardBody tableWrap">
 <p class="tiny">Each phone belongs to one operator and their operating branch. Complete supported confirmations can create pending verification records. Unknown SMS stays here for review. SMS does not prove provider settlement.</p>
 <details><summary>Supported confirmation format</summary><p class="tiny">Current explicit profile: <code>MTN Cash In: UGX 1,000; Fee: UGX 10; Customer: Jane Doe; Ref: ABC12345</code>. Cash Out, Airtel, M-Pesa and MTN SSD equivalents are supported with an explicit UGX, USD, SSP or KES currency. For example, <code>MTN SSD Cash In: SSP 1,000.00; Fee: SSP 10.00; Customer: Jane Doe; Ref: SSD12345</code>. Provider wording varies; other formats are captured for manual review. Fees and operation direction are never guessed.</p></details>
 <table><thead><tr><th>Received (UTC)</th><th>Sender</th><th>Reference</th><th>Status</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody>
 <% data.items.forEach(item=>{ %><tr><td><%= new Date(item.receivedAt).toISOString().slice(0,16).replace('T',' ') %></td><td><%= item.sender %></td><td><%= item.fields?.networkReference || 'Needs review' %></td><td><span class="tag"><%= item.state.replaceAll('_',' ') %></span></td><td><a class="btn" href="/tenant/sms-capture/<%= item._id %>">Open SMS</a></td></tr><% }) %>
 </tbody></table><% if(!data.items.length){ %><p class="tiny">No SMS received. Connect an Android relay using an enrolled device below. Manual entry is ready to use.</p><% } %><% if(data.nextCursor){ %><a class="btn" href="/tenant/sms-capture?cursor=<%= encodeURIComponent(data.nextCursor) %>">Older captured SMS</a><% } %></div></section>
 <section class="card" style="margin-top:14px"><div class="cardHead"><b>Connected devices</b><span>Revoking a device immediately stops new submissions</span></div><div class="cardBody tableWrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Device</th><th>Network</th><th>Capture mode</th><th>Last received (UTC)</th><th>Status</th><% if(data.canManage){ %><th>Action</th><% } %></tr></thead><tbody>
 <% data.devices.forEach(device=>{ %><tr><td><%= device.name %></td><td><%= device.network %></td><td><%= device.autoRecord?'Auto-record complete confirmations':'Review every SMS' %></td><td><%= device.lastReceivedAt?new Date(device.lastReceivedAt).toISOString().slice(0,16).replace('T',' '):'Waiting for relay' %></td><td><%= device.status %></td><% if(data.canManage){ %><td><% if(device.status==='active'){ %><form method="post" action="/tenant/sms-capture/devices/<%= device.deviceId %>/revoke"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><button class="btn" type="submit">Revoke</button></form><% } %></td><% } %></tr><% }) %>
 </tbody></table></div></section>
 <% if(data.canManage){ %><section class="card" style="margin-top:14px"><div class="cardHead"><b>Connect an Android SMS relay</b><span>Tenant Owner setup</span></div><div class="cardBody">
 <p class="tiny">Install the Android relay from the repository’s <code>tools/android-sms-relay</code> guide. Grant SMS access on the phone, keep its clock accurate and select only provider senders. Enrollment supplies a unique endpoint and secret once. An operator’s branch is determined from their account.</p>
 <form method="post" action="/tenant/sms-capture/devices" autocomplete="off" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);min-width:0;gap:12px"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
 <label class="field">Phone name<input class="control" name="name" minlength="3" maxlength="80" required placeholder="Main counter MTN phone"></label>
 <label class="field">Assigned operator<select class="control" name="operatorId" required><option value="">Choose an active operator</option><% data.operators.forEach(operator=>{ %><option value="<%= operator._id %>"><%= operator.name %> · <%= operator.role %></option><% }) %></select></label>
 <label class="field">Provider network<select class="control" name="network" required><option value="MTN">MTN</option><option value="MTN SSD">MTN SSD (South Sudan)</option><option value="Airtel">Airtel</option><option value="M-Pesa">M-Pesa</option></select></label>
 <label class="field">Trusted SMS senders<input class="control" name="allowedSenders" maxlength="300" required placeholder="MTNMOMO, 12345"><span class="tiny">Exact sender names or numbers, separated by commas. Use senders verified on this phone.</span></label>
 <label class="moduleChoice"><input type="checkbox" name="autoRecord" value="on"><span>Automatically record supported confirmations</span></label>
 <p class="tiny">Keep this unchecked until your actual provider messages match the supported format and the independently verified cash shift is open. Failed or incomplete records stay in the inbox. Manual entry remains available on every SMS-assisted plan.</p>
 <button class="btn btnPrimary" type="submit">Enroll Android phone</button></form></div></section><% } %>
</section>
